invalid type: string "Cellular Networks (304192) - Quick Revision Notes\n1. Hata Model\nUsed for path loss prediction in urban areas. Depends on frequency, antenna height, and distance.\n2. OFDM\nOrthogonal Frequency Division Multiplexing divides bandwidth into multiple orthogonal subcarriers.\n3. BER\nBit Error Rate measures error probability. Rayleigh channel has higher BER than AWGN.\n4. MIMO\n